    "body": "Some more found by the regex in the lint PR piped with `grep -E \"<(h[1-6]|dfn)\"`\n\n```\n59421:   <span>task source</span> for this task is the <dfn>canvas blob serialisation task\n65548:  <h5>Colour spaces and colour correction</h5>\n90360:  <p>The <dfn>timer initialisation steps</dfn>, which are invoked with some method arguments, a <var>method context</var>, a <var>repeat</var> flag which can be true or false, and\n110907:  <h4>The <code>input</code> element as a colour well</h4>\n111454:    <p>The <dfn>frame border colour</dfn> of a <code>frameset</code> or <code>frame</code> element\n```\n",
