    "body": "> I found this with various primitive regular expressions; searching for various parts of obvious words \"ise\", \"iou\", etc. in combination with `</dfn>`.\n\nOK, so it's possible it missed some things. When actually changing spellings, the reviewer will have to take care to check if any IDs at all change. Something simple like dumping the values of all id attributes as a list before and after.\n",
