    "updated_at": "2016-08-31T11:00:51Z",
    "body": "There are a whole bunch of IDs changed for backrefs on links, but I think those are OK to break; they're only intended for the spec itself, not intended to be linked to from other specs.\n\nApart from that I find these\n\n``` diff\n<  id=concept-url-serialiser\n>  id=concept-url-serializer\n<  id=host-serialiser\n>  id=host-serializer\n<  id=serialise-an-integer\n>  id=serialize-an-integer\n<  id=named-colour\n>  id=named-color\n<  id=serialising-a-css-value\n>  id=serializing-a-css-value\n<  id=reinitialise-url\n>  id=reinitialize-url\n<  id=textarea-line-break-normalisation-transformation\n>  id=textarea-line-break-normalization-transformation\n<  id=canvas-blob-serialisation-task-source\n>  id=canvas-blob-serialization-task-source\n<  id=serialisation-of-a-colour\n>  id=serialization-of-a-color\n<  id=activation-behaviour\n>  id=activation-behavior\n<  id=initialise-the-document-object\n>  id=initialize-the-document-object\n<  id=timer-initialisation-steps\n>  id=timer-initialization-steps\n<  id=storage-object-initialisation-steps\n>  id=storage-object-initialization-steps\n```\n\nMethod:\n1. Run `./build.sh` for `switch-to-en-us`\n2. `grep -Eo \"\\sid=\\\"?([^\\\" >]+)\\\"?\" output/index > ids-en-us.txt`\n3. Run `./build.sh` for `master`\n4. `grep -Eo \"\\sid=\\\"?([^\\\" >]+)\\\"?\" output/index > ids-en-gb.txt`\n5. `diff ids-en-gb.txt ids-en-us.txt | grep -Ev \"(:|---|\\d+c\\d+)\"`\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
